                    <li>Provide statistical summaries and visualizations of recorded incidents;</li>
                    <li>Organize recorded incidents according to applicable classifications, including <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">8-Focus, Non-Index, and PSI</strong> categories;</li>
